{"type": "spr", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The ratio <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> to <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> is equivalent to the ratio <math alttext=\"63\"><mn>63</mn>\n</math> to <math alttext=\"17\"><mn>17</mn>\n</math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> when <math alttext=\"b equals 153\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>b</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>153</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>", "keys": ["567"], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"567\"><mn>567</mn>\n</math>. It's given that the ratio <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> to <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> is equivalent to the ratio <math alttext=\"63\"><mn>63</mn>\n</math> to <math alttext=\"17\"><mn>17</mn>\n</math>, or <math alttext=\"StartFraction a Over b EndFraction equals StartFraction 63 Over 17 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mi>a</mi>\n<mi>b</mi>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mfrac>\n<mn>63</mn>\n<mn>17</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>. When <math alttext=\"b equals 153\"><mrow>\n<mi>b</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>153</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, the value of <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> can be calculated by substituting <math alttext=\"153\"><mn>153</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> in the equation <math alttext=\"StartFraction a Over b EndFraction equals StartFraction 63 Over 17 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mi>a</mi>\n<mi>b</mi>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mfrac>\n<mn>63</mn>\n<mn>17</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>, which yields <math alttext=\"StartFraction a Over 153 EndFraction equals StartFraction 63 Over 17 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mi>a</mi>\n<mn>153</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mfrac>\n<mn>63</mn>\n<mn>17</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Multiplying both sides of this equation by <math alttext=\"153\"><mn>153</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"a equals 567\"><mrow>\n<mi>a</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>567</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Thus, when <math alttext=\"b equals 153\"><mrow>\n<mi>b</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>153</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, the value of <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"567\"><mn>567</mn>\n</math>.</p>", "externalid": "98ff2d18-fd0b-4125-ae68-dffac04ee1ef", "correct_answer": ["567"]}